# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mania Replay Viewer - ignore rules
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored (committed on purpose):
#   packages/           offline NuGet feed. NuGet.org is unreachable on the build machine (offline
#                       CRL check -> NU1301), so restore only works from this committed flat feed.
#   tests/golden/       frozen reference JSON produced by the shipped v2.4.0 jar - the differential
#                       evidence for the Core judgement layer. Large, but it is the test oracle.
#   fixtures/           beatmaps/replays copied out of the game install (never written back to it).
#   docs/app-smoke.png  UI smoke-test screenshot evidence.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Build output
bin/
obj/
out/
artifacts/
TestResults/

# Render/encode artefacts - a video must never land in the repository
*.mp4
*.tmp
*.log

# IDE / editor / user-specific state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.DotSettings.user
*.sln.docstates
*.sln.ide/

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Portable .NET 8 SDK (large, machine-specific, re-extracted rather than committed)
tools/dotnet8/
